# The same artifacts from examples/c/build.ps1, plus what Windows links and
# loads alongside them: an import library per DLL, and the kui_ffi.dll the
# hosts need beside them because there is no rpath. `panel-dll` is the
# second plugin shape - the one that imports kui_ffi.dll rather than a
# host, and so loads into any of them.
